# Normalize line endings to LF regardless of the checkout platform's git
# config. Without this, a Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true checks out
# docker-entrypoint.sh with CRLF endings, which crash-loops the container
# ("exec ./docker-entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory" -- the shebang
# `#!/bin/sh\r` is invalid inside Linux).
* text=auto eol=lf
